    "title": "Man shot by ICE officer in New York City - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jonathan Dienst ,\n4 hours ago An ICE officer shot a man during a “targeted enforcement operation” Thursday afternoon in New York, the U.S. Department of Homeland Security said. The shooting happened around 4 p.m. along Marble Hill Avenue as officers were seeking a “criminal illegal alien from the Dominican Republic” who had a prior conviction for grand larceny, DHS said in a statement Thursday evening. Read full article",
